Initially, we examine the CTL runs during the early half of the period (Fig. 5a–d). During this phase, easterly winds from the KE-LM region directed toward the heavy precipitation area in eastern Chiba Prefecture near the surface (Fig. 5a). Near the coast of eastern Chiba Prefecture, a pronounced east–west contrast in equivalent potential temperature (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
