				\begin{document}$$\:{\theta\:}_{e}$$\end{document}) at 500 m altitude is observed (Fig. 5b), and a surface front characterized by steep horizontal \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
